 ## Background
-The technique is widely used in real-time fluid simulation to define the domain of the solver. It allows the simulation to ignore air ($\phi \ge 0$) and only compute pressure and forces within the liquid ($\phi < 0$) [S2, unofficial]. The approach is detailed in *GPU Gems 3* regarding real-time 3D fluid simulation [S2, unofficial].
